 x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/351397/rigs-of-rods\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" data-label=\"related_btn\"><svg height=\"18\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_medium family_lato\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE3NDg5ODcucG5n/original/fUc2SO.png\" alt=\"Rigs of Rods\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Rigs of Rods</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_902108\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows and Linux</p><div class=\"direct_download_row\"><button class=\"button direct_download_btn\" type=\"button\"><svg height=\"22\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_download\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" width=\"22\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> Download</button></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h1 class=\"text-center\">Dive into soft body physics</h1>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">Rigs of Rods is a sandbox-style vehicle simulator</h2>\r\n<p>What makes Rigs of Rods different to most simulators is its unique soft-body physics model: vehicles, machines, objects, etc. are simulated in real-time as flexible soft-body objects, giving the simulation an extremely accurate behavior which entirely\r\n  depends on the physical construction of the vehicles or objects you create.\r\n</p>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-center\">Entirely Free and Open Source</h1>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\"><strong>Community driven</strong> and <strong>developed</strong>, anyone can <strong>join and contribute</strong></h2>\r\n<p><button itchio aria-label=\"Click to activate iframe embed\" type=\"button\" class=\"embed_preload other_embed\" title=\"https://discordapp.com/widget?id=136544456244461568&amp;theme=dark\" data-embed_code=\"&lt;iframe frameborder=&quot;0&quot; height=&quot;350&quot; width=&quot;350&quot; src=&quot;https://discordapp.com/widget?id=136544456244461568&amp;theme=dark&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" style=\"height: 168px; width: 300px\"><div class=\"embed_url\">https://discordapp.com/widget?id=136544456244461568&amp;theme=dark</div></button></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">Important notes:</h2>\r\n<ul><li>Rigs of Rods isn&#x27;t a beginner-friendly game, so I recommend to read the Beginner&#x27;s Guide first:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.rigsofrods.org/gameplay/beginners-guide/#first-run\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://docs.rigsofrods.org/gameplay/beginners-guide/#first-run</a><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://rigsofrods.cf/gameplay/beginners-guide/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\"></a></li>\r\n<li>If you need any support, join our discord server and post you issue in #game-support. Make sure you read the channel descript